{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useQueryClient(): QueryClient;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/context.ts#L105","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/lit-query/src/context.ts:105"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resolves the current default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":" registered by a connected\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClientProvider"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This helper is useful outside a Lit reactive controller when a single\nprovider is mounted. It throws if no client is registered or if multiple\nclients are mounted and the default would be ambiguous."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../classes/QueryClient.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The single registered query client."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"throws","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Throws"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":" is registered, or if multiple are\nmounted and the default is ambiguous."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"throws","text":"Throws","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useQueryClient(): QueryClient;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/context.ts:105](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/context.ts#L105)\n\nResolves the current default `QueryClient` registered by a connected\n`QueryClientProvider`.\n\nThis helper is useful outside a Lit reactive controller when a single\nprovider is mounted. It throws if no client is registered or if multiple\nclients are mounted and the default would be ambiguous.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nThe single registered query client.\n\n## Throws\n\nIf no `QueryClient` is registered, or if multiple are\nmounted and the default is ambiguous.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useQueryClient\ntitle: useQueryClient\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useQueryClient(): QueryClient;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/context.ts:105](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/context.ts#L105)\n\nResolves the current default `QueryClient` registered by a connected\n`QueryClientProvider`.\n\nThis helper is useful outside a Lit reactive controller when a single\nprovider is mounted. It throws if no client is registered or if multiple\nclients are mounted and the default would be ambiguous.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nThe single registered query client.\n\n## Throws\n\nIf no `QueryClient` is registered, or if multiple are\nmounted and the default is ambiguous.\n"}
